      "title": "[ArchDaily] Creative Rebellion: Design, Knowledge and Experimentation at interihotel MAD26",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.archdaily.com&amp;sz=128\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>From November 17 to 19, 2026, interihotel MAD26 will bring together architects, interior designers, hospitality operators, and specialized brands at IFEMA <a href=\"https://www.archdaily.com/tag/madrid\">Madrid</a>. Organized by AMBIT Living Spaces Cluster, the event is expected to welcome more than 14,000 professionals, 350 exhibiting brands, and over 200 international speakers. Under the theme Creative Rebellion, it will combine talks, workshops, five specialized forums, and full-scale experimental spaces to explore new approaches to hotel and restaurant design.</p>",
